ent (/openapi/v1.json) and a page to read and try it (/swagger). Keep both: the factory's product page links to the page.\napp.MapOpenApi();\napp.UseSwaggerUI(o => o.SwaggerEndpoint(\"/openapi/v1.json\", \"API\"));"}],"ears":"The Folio3 Parking API shall implement `GET` and `PUT /admin/settings` to read and update administrator-managed office timezone, release time, and report recipients and to return contract-defined schedule fields.","id":"REQ-7","op":"MODIFIED","sources":["I-1","ASM-3","ASM-7","ASM-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An authorized integration request describes a car whose plate has an active temporary parking authorization for the office date.","id":"AC-8.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned `EntranceVerification` identifies the plate as authorized, includes office date and time and contract-defined entry status, and sets `greenActivationRequested` to true.","when":"The integration sends the detection to `POST /integrations/entrance/detections`."},{"given":"An authorized integration request describes a car without a valid temporary allocation, a pedestrian, motorcycle, or other non-car object, or a vehicle with a permanent parking sticker.","id":"AC-8.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned verification denies an unauthorized car, marks a non-car object as not applicable, or identifies a permanent sticker with entry status `Not blocked`; `greenActivationRequested` is false for each of these cases.","when":"The integration sends the detection to `POST /integrations/entrance/detections`."},{"given":"A detection request has valid `detectedObjectType` and `detectedAt` fields and, where applicable, a plate or failure reason.","id":"AC-8.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response body contains the verification identifier, office date and time, plate, verification, entry status, `greenActivationRequested`, and detail; invalid input has response status 400.","when":"The integration sends the request to `POST /integrations/entrance/detections`."},{"given":"A detection contains a failure reason or the verification service is unavailable.","id":"AC-8.4","level":"api","then":"The returned verification is fail-closed and requests no green activation; a verification-service outage has response status 503 and the response body conforms to `ApiError` with error code `service_unavailable`.","when":"The integration sends the detection to `POST /integrations/entrance/detections`."},{"given":"An integration client submits a successful or unsuccessful detection.","id":"AC-8.5","level":"api","then":"A corresponding database row records the office date and time, plate when present, verification result, and entry status.","when":"The API processes the detection request."},{"given":"An integration request lacks the required access token.","id":"AC-8.6","level":"api","then":"The response status is 401 and the response body conforms to `ApiError`.","when":"The API receives the detection request."}],"anchors":[{"lineEnd":31,"lineStart":28,"path":"App.Api/Program.cs","quote":"app.MapGet(\"/\", () => \"API is up\").ExcludeFromDescription();\n// The API's own document (/openapi/v1.json) and a page to read and try it (/swagger). Keep both: the factory's product page links to the page.\napp.MapOpenApi();\napp.UseSwaggerUI(o => o.SwaggerEndpoint(\"/openapi/v1.json\", \"API\"));"}],"ears":"The Folio3 Parking API shall implement `POST /integrations/entrance/detections` with the contract-defined request, response, security, and status behavior, recording detections and returning verification decisions without operating physical entrance hardware.","id":"REQ-8","op":"MODIFIED","sources":["I-1","ASM-4","ASM-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The API is configured through `ConnectionStrings:App` with an isolated PostgreSQL database, and a test creates its own employee, vehicle, and parking fixtures with demo seeding disabled.","id":"AC-9.1","le